// =============================================================================
// GUIDELINES:
// =============================================================================
// 1. TWO composables: ScreenRoot (stateful) and Screen (stateless)
// 2. ScreenRoot handles:
//    - ViewModel injection with koinViewModel()
//    - State collection with collectAsStateWithLifecycle()
//    - Navigation observation with LaunchedEffect(state.destination)
//    - ALWAYS call viewModel.clearDestination() after navigating
// 3. Screen is a pure function:
//    - Receives state and emits actions
//    - No ViewModel reference
//    - No side effects
// 4. Use ExScaffold as root layout
// 5. Use design system components from core/design_system/
// 6. Dialogs render OUTSIDE the scaffold
// 7. Use ExTheme.spacing for consistent spacing
// =============================================================================
